    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-present-weapon-or-tool-needs-secure-carrying-and-access","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Наличное оружие или ручной инструмент требуют надёжного ношения либо размещения, сочетая удержание, доступ и свободу движения. Это не задаёт владельца, умение или применение.","search_aliases":["нести оружие","убрать инструмент"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-present-weapon-or-tool-needs-secure-carrying-and-access","locale":"en","runtime_text":"A present weapon or hand tool needs carrying or placement that balances retention, access, and movement. It sets no owner, skill, or use.","search_aliases":["carry weapon","stow tool"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-protective-layers-and-shields-need-fit-and-clearance","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Наличным защитным слоям, щитам или шлемам могут требоваться подгонка и просвет для движения, зрения и доступа. Защита и исход боя не заданы.","search_aliases":["щит мешает","подогнать шлем"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-protective-layers-and-shields-need-fit-and-clearance","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Present protective layers, shields, or helmets can need fit and clearance for movement, sight, and access. Protection and combat outcome are unset.","search_aliases":["shield fit","adjust helmet"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-wood-leather-textile-and-metal-equipment-can-show-condition-before-use","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Наличное снаряжение из дерева, кожи, ткани или металла можно осмотреть по видимому состоянию перед использованием. Скрытое повреждение и отказ не определяются.","search_aliases":["осмотреть снаряжение"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-wood-leather-textile-and-metal-equipment-can-show-condition-before-use","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Present wood, leather, textile, or metal equipment can be inspected for visible condition before use. Hidden damage and failure are unset.","search_aliases":["inspect equipment"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-worn-fastening-or-covering-can-be-limited-repaired-replaced-or-deferred-conditionally","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Видимый износ крепления, края или покрытия можно ограничить, чинить, заменить либо отложить по доступным средствам. Успех не гарантирован.","search_aliases":["изношенное крепление"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-worn-fastening-or-covering-can-be-limited-repaired-replaced-or-deferred-conditionally","locale":"en","runtime_text":"A visible worn fastening, edge, or covering can be limited, repaired, replaced, or deferred as means allow. Success is not guaranteed.","search_aliases":["worn fastening"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-after-birth-mother-and-newborn-need-continuing-observation-and-available-support","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"После уже установленного рождения матери и младенцу могут требоваться наблюдение, тепло, кормление и доступная поддержка. Осложнение, диагноз и исход не заданы.","search_aliases":["после родов мать младенец"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-after-birth-mother-and-newborn-need-continuing-observation-and-available-support","locale":"en","runtime_text":"After an established birth, mother and newborn can need observation, warmth, feeding, and available support. Complication, diagnosis, and outcome are unset.","search_aliases":["after birth support"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-postnatal-care-can-share-attention-between-parent-infant-and-household-needs","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Послеродовой уход может распределять внимание между родителем, младенцем, теплом, кормлением, отдыхом и домом. Помощник и расписание не создаются.","search_aliases":["послеродовой уход дом"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-postnatal-care-can-share-attention-between-parent-infant-and-household-needs","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Postnatal care can share attention between parent, infant, warmth, feeding, rest, and household needs. No helper or schedule is created.","search_aliases":["postnatal household care"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-severe-or-worsening-postnatal-concerns-need-available-experienced-assessment-without-diagnosis","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Тяжёлые либо нарастающие послеродовые тревоги могут быть поводом искать доступную опытную оценку без диагноза или назначения лечения.","search_aliases":["тревога после родов"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-severe-or-worsening-postnatal-concerns-need-available-experienced-assessment-without-diagnosis","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Severe or worsening postnatal concerns can justify available experienced assessment without diagnosis or treatment.","search_aliases":["postnatal concern"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-uncertain-toxic-contact-can-call-for-distance-from-source-and-observation","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Неясный уже наблюдаемый токсичный контакт или вдыхание может требовать отойти от источника и наблюдать изменения. Вещество, доза, отравление и исход не заданы.","search_aliases":["неизвестное вещество"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-uncertain-toxic-contact-can-call-for-distance-from-source-and-observation","locale":"en","runtime_text":"An uncertain observed toxic contact or inhalation context can call for distance from the source and observation. Substance, dose, poisoning, and outcome are unset.","search_aliases":["unknown substance"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-uncertain-exposure-needs-route-and-source-details-preserved-for-help","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"При доступной помощи неясное воздействие можно описать по источнику, пути, времени и изменениям, не превращая наблюдение в диагноз.","search_aliases":["описать воздействие"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-uncertain-exposure-needs-route-and-source-details-preserved-for-help","locale":"en","runtime_text":"With available help, uncertain exposure can be described by source, route, timing, and changes without turning observations into diagnosis.","search_aliases":["describe exposure"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-parasite-concern-can-support-hygiene-observation-and-contextual-help-without-diagnosis","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Подозрение на паразита может обосновывать гигиену, наблюдение и поиск помощи по обстоятельствам, но не доказывает паразита, заражение или лечение.","search_aliases":["подозрение на паразитов"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-parasite-concern-can-support-hygiene-observation-and-contextual-help-without-diagnosis","locale":"en","runtime_text":"A parasite concern can support hygiene, observation, and contextual help seeking, not proof of parasite, infection, or treatment.","search_aliases":["parasite concern"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-stored-organic-goods-need-condition-checks-for-moisture-odour-or-visible-change","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Хранимые органические вещи можно проверять на влагу, запах или видимые изменения для осторожного обращения. Порча и потеря не доказаны.","search_aliases":["проверить припасы"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-stored-organic-goods-need-condition-checks-for-moisture-odour-or-visible-change","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Stored organic goods can be checked for moisture, odour, or visible change for cautious handling. Spoilage and loss are not proven.","search_aliases":["check stored goods"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-storage-separation-and-air-movement-can-limit-interference-when-available","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"При доступных месте и проёмах отделение сырого или сомнительного материала и движение воздуха могут уменьшать помехи без гарантии сушки.","search_aliases":["проветрить хранение"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-storage-separation-and-air-movement-can-limit-interference-when-available","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Where space and openings exist, separation and air movement can limit interference without guaranteeing drying.","search_aliases":["ventilate storage"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-stored-goods-condition-can-change-with-air-moisture-and-time-without-fixed-rate","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Состояние уже хранимых вещей может меняться с влажностью воздуха и временем без фиксированной скорости, причины или исхода.","search_aliases":["влажное хранение"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-stored-goods-condition-can-change-with-air-moisture-and-time-without-fixed-rate","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Stored-goods condition can change with air moisture and time without fixed rate, cause, or outcome.","search_aliases":["damp storage"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-wet-netting-and-cordage-can-need-inspection-drying-and-repair-before-reuse","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Мокрые сети или снасти могут требовать осмотра, сушки и условной починки перед повторным применением. Сеть, владелец и успех не создаются.","search_aliases":["мокрая сеть"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-wet-netting-and-cordage-can-need-inspection-drying-and-repair-before-reuse","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Wet netting or cordage can need inspection, drying, and conditional repair before reuse. No net, owner, or success is created.","search_aliases":["wet net"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-wet-wooden-hull-or-boat-seam-needs-local-inspection-before-repair-or-travel","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Мокрый деревянный корпус или шов лодки можно местно осмотреть перед ремонтом либо ходом. Течь, прочность, доступ и безопасный путь не заданы.","search_aliases":["осмотреть шов лодки"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-wet-wooden-hull-or-boat-seam-needs-local-inspection-before-repair-or-travel","locale":"en","runtime_text":"A wet wooden hull or boat seam can be inspected locally before repair or travel. Leak, strength, access, and safe voyage are unset.","search_aliases":["inspect boat seam"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-wet-gear-and-hull-care-compete-for-space-time-and-dry-work-area","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Уход за мокрой снастью или корпусом конкурирует за место, время и сухую рабочую площадку без расписания или результата.","search_aliases":["сушить снасть"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-wet-gear-and-hull-care-compete-for-space-time-and-dry-work-area","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Wet-gear or hull care competes for space, time, and dry work area without schedule or result.","search_aliases":["dry gear"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-water-cooling-applies-to-ordinary-solid-combustibles-not-every-fire","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Охлаждение водой уместно для уже установленного огня обычных твёрдых горючих материалов, но класс топлива надо знать или осторожно оценить. Это не любой пожар.","search_aliases":["вода на дерево огонь"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-water-cooling-applies-to-ordinary-solid-combustibles-not-every-fire","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Water cooling can matter for established ordinary solid-combustible fire, but fuel class needs cautious assessment. It is not every fire.","search_aliases":["water wood fire"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-fire-response-needs-escape-distance-and-avoiding-unknown-electrical-liquid-or-oil-hazards","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Ответ на огонь требует пути отхода и осторожности с неясными электрическими, горючими жидкостями или жировыми опасностями; способ и исход не заданы.","search_aliases":["уйти от огня"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:final-practical-fire-response-needs-escape-distance-and-avoiding-unknown-electrical-liquid-or-oil-hazards","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Fire response needs escape and caution around unknown electrical, flammable-liquid, or oil hazards; method and outcome are unset.","search_aliases":["escape fire"]}
